// Syncthing ignore rules for the shopkeeper project.
//
// This file is SYNCED to every machine. Each machine's Syncthing share root
// (Projects/.stignore) pulls it in with a single line:
//
//     #include shopkeeper/.syncignore
//
// Syncthing interprets all patterns relative to the share ROOT (Projects/),
// which is why every line is prefixed with "shopkeeper/".
//
// Rule of thumb: sync code + db/dumps (portable data) + .env. Never sync the
// live database, virtualenvs, model files, or caches — they are machine- and
// version-specific, and syncing the live DB would corrupt it.

shopkeeper/db/data
shopkeeper/.venv
shopkeeper/venv
shopkeeper/env
shopkeeper/models
shopkeeper/.pytest_cache
shopkeeper/.ruff_cache
shopkeeper/.mypy_cache
shopkeeper/**/__pycache__
shopkeeper/**/*.pyc
shopkeeper/**/*.gguf
shopkeeper/**/*.bin
